MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

现象：eip93_send_req() 里 sa_state_ctr（CTR 计数器回绕时的第二份状态记录）映射失败时跳到 free_sa_state_ctr，那里会撤销还没映射的 sa_state；sa_state 映射失败时跳到 free_sa_state_ctr_dma，那里会撤销这个映射失败的句柄。两处都会对无效的 DMA 地址调 dma_unmap_single()。上游原样驱动同样如此（评审指出，读码）。

根因：出错标签的顺序是“先撤销 sa_state_ctr、释放它，再撤销 sa_state”，与映射顺序（先 sa_state_ctr、后 sa_state）不是反序，失败点之后还没映射的那一份也被撤销。

改法：标签改成映射的反序：unmap_sa_state → unmap_sa_state_ctr → free_sa_state_ctr → free_sa_state；sa_state_ctr 映射失败跳到 free_sa_state_ctr（只释放两块内存），sa_state 映射失败跳到 unmap_sa_state_ctr，请求 ID 分配失败跳到 unmap_sa_state。释放后把两个指针清成 NULL。

实测：EN7528 上是 dma-direct、低端内存，映射不会失败，这两条路走不到；修前修后功能相同，testmgr FULL、压力测试通过（读码定性，未上机触发）。详见 build/research/eip93-driver-fixes.md。

---
 .../crypto/inside-secure/eip93/eip93-common.c | 20 +++++++++++--------
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/crypto/inside-secure/eip93/eip93-common.c b/drivers/crypto/inside-secure/eip93/eip93-common.c
index 81db168..2db02be 100644
--- a/drivers/crypto/inside-secure/eip93/eip93-common.c
+++ b/drivers/crypto/inside-secure/eip93/eip93-common.c
@@ -622,7 +622,7 @@ int eip93_send_req(struct crypto_async_request *async,
 								 DMA_BIDIRECTIONAL);
 			err = dma_mapping_error(eip93->dev, rctx->sa_state_ctr_base);
 			if (err)
-				goto free_sa_state_ctr;
+				goto free_sa_state_ctr;	/* sa_state 还没映射 */
 		}
 	}
 
@@ -631,7 +631,7 @@ int eip93_send_req(struct crypto_async_request *async,
 					     sizeof(*rctx->sa_state), DMA_BIDIRECTIONAL);
 	err = dma_mapping_error(eip93->dev, rctx->sa_state_base);
 	if (err)
-		goto free_sa_state_ctr_dma;
+		goto unmap_sa_state_ctr;
 
 skip_iv:
 
@@ -645,7 +645,7 @@ skip_iv:
 					     EIP93_REQ_ID_NUM, GFP_ATOMIC);
 	if (crypto_async_idr < 0) {
 		err = crypto_async_idr;
-		goto free_sa_state_ctr_dma;
+		goto unmap_sa_state;
 	}
 
 	cdesc.user_id = FIELD_PREP(EIP93_PE_USER_ID_CRYPTO_IDR, crypto_async_idr) |
@@ -678,19 +678,23 @@ free_sg_dma:
 free_idr:
 	scoped_guard(spinlock_bh, &eip93->ring->idr_lock)
 		idr_remove(&eip93->ring->crypto_async_idr, crypto_async_idr);
-free_sa_state_ctr_dma:
+	/* 按映射的反序撤销：sa_state 最后映射，先撤销；ECB 两者都为 NULL */
+unmap_sa_state:
+	if (rctx->sa_state)
+		dma_unmap_single(eip93->dev, rctx->sa_state_base,
+				 sizeof(*rctx->sa_state),
+				 DMA_BIDIRECTIONAL);
+unmap_sa_state_ctr:
 	if (rctx->sa_state_ctr)
 		dma_unmap_single(eip93->dev, rctx->sa_state_ctr_base,
 				 sizeof(*rctx->sa_state_ctr),
 				 DMA_BIDIRECTIONAL);
 free_sa_state_ctr:
 	kfree(rctx->sa_state_ctr);
-	if (rctx->sa_state)
-		dma_unmap_single(eip93->dev, rctx->sa_state_base,
-				 sizeof(*rctx->sa_state),
-				 DMA_BIDIRECTIONAL);
+	rctx->sa_state_ctr = NULL;
 free_sa_state:
 	kfree(rctx->sa_state);
+	rctx->sa_state = NULL;
 
 	return err;
 }
